{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/1af8611700afe02f515ed0ad3b771b8b.avif?t=1755694249\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/567f470e5bf0f2f2053f25ddf08f6478.poster.avif?t=1755694249\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/567f470e5bf0f2f2053f25ddf08f6478.webm?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/567f470e5bf0f2f2053f25ddf08f6478.mp4?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The game takes place in the subconscious mind of its female protagonist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an old, abandoned wrestling gym. It is empty, silent\u2026 but the silence is deceiving. Soon, you realize that you are not just a night watchman\u2014you are trapped in the distorted space of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This abandoned gym is merely a shell.</strong> Inside, it holds fragments of the past, broken memories, and entities that conceal a terrifying truth. You must explore this unsettling world, facing what was meant to be forgotten, time and time again.<br><strong>But are you ready to see where it all leads?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FEATURES: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/8939bb98bc033fce14bcce68fbe1f2f8.poster.avif?t=1755694249\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/8939bb98bc033fce14bcce68fbe1f2f8.webm?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/8939bb98bc033fce14bcce68fbe1f2f8.mp4?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique experience from gameplay and atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true dive into the unconscious. Filled with important memories and images.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The unusual storytelling. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple types of gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/2232369833c7174f877c0876ee29ead3.poster.avif?t=1755694249\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/2232369833c7174f877c0876ee29ead3.webm?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556360/extras/2232369833c7174f877c0876ee29ead3.mp4?t=1755694249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main duties include: to sit in your office and watch what is happening inside. It is important to realize that you are not alone here...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the possibilities at your disposal so that no one enters your office.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After night shifts, you can leave your workplace. To explore this confusing and mysterious place.</p></li></ul>","background":"https:/